  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "A pinch of impurity changes everything",
    "kn": "ಒಂದು ಚಿಟಿಕೆ ಅಪದ್ರವ್ಯ ಎಲ್ಲವನ್ನೂ ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "Add one arsenic atom for every few million silicon atoms and the conductivity rises a thousandfold or more. This is doping.",
    "kn": "ಕೆಲವು ಲಕ್ಷ ಸಿಲಿಕಾನ್ ಪರಮಾಣುಗಳಿಗೆ ಒಂದು ಆರ್ಸೆನಿಕ್ ಪರಮಾಣು ಸೇರಿಸಿದರೆ ವಾಹಕತೆ ಸಾವಿರ ಪಟ್ಟಿಗೂ ಹೆಚ್ಚುತ್ತದೆ. ಇದೇ ಡೋಪಿಂಗ್."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Explain n-type and p-type doping"
    },
    {
     "en": "Identify majority and minority carriers"
    },
    {
     "en": "Use n_e n_h = n_i²"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Add one arsenic atom for every few million silicon atoms and the conductivity rises a thousandfold or more. This is doping.",
    "kn": "ಕೆಲವು ಲಕ್ಷ ಸಿಲಿಕಾನ್ ಪರಮಾಣುಗಳಿಗೆ ಒಂದು ಆರ್ಸೆನಿಕ್ ಪರಮಾಣು ಸೇರಿಸಿದರೆ ವಾಹಕತೆ ಸಾವಿರ ಪಟ್ಟಿಗೂ ಹೆಚ್ಚುತ್ತದೆ. ಇದೇ ಡೋಪಿಂಗ್."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "n-type and p-type"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "A pentavalent dopant (As, Sb, P) uses four electrons for bonds; the fifth is loosely held and easily freed. It is a donor, and the crystal is n-type, with electrons as majority carriers. A trivalent dopant (B, Al, Ga, In) leaves one bond incomplete, creating a hole; it is an acceptor, and the crystal is p-type, with holes as majority carriers. Either way the crystal stays electrically neutral.",
    "kn": "ಪಂಚವೇಲೆನ್ಸ್ ಅಪದ್ರವ್ಯ (As, Sb, P) ದಾನಿ; n-ಮಾದರಿ, ಎಲೆಕ್ಟ್ರಾನ್‌ಗಳು ಬಹುಸಂಖ್ಯಾತ ವಾಹಕಗಳು. ತ್ರಿವೇಲೆನ್ಸ್ ಅಪದ್ರವ್ಯ (B, Al, Ga, In) ಸ್ವೀಕಾರಕ; p-ಮಾದರಿ, ರಂಧ್ರಗಳು ಬಹುಸಂಖ್ಯಾತ. ಸ್ಫಟಿಕ ವಿದ್ಯುತ್ ತಟಸ್ಥ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "n-type: group 15 donors, n_e ≫ n_h"
    },
    {
     "en": "p-type: group 13 acceptors, n_h ≫ n_e"
    },
    {
     "en": "Both remain neutral"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "A pentavalent dopant (As, Sb, P) uses four electrons for bonds; the fifth is loosely held and easily freed. It is a donor, and the crystal is n-type, with electrons as majority carriers. A trivalent dopant (B, Al, Ga, In) leaves one bond incomplete, creating a hole; it is an acceptor, and the crystal is p-type, with holes as majority carriers. Either way the crystal stays electrically neutral.",
    "kn": "ಪಂಚವೇಲೆನ್ಸ್ ಅಪದ್ರವ್ಯ (As, Sb, P) ದಾನಿ; n-ಮಾದರಿ, ಎಲೆಕ್ಟ್ರಾನ್‌ಗಳು ಬಹುಸಂಖ್ಯಾತ ವಾಹಕಗಳು. ತ್ರಿವೇಲೆನ್ಸ್ ಅಪದ್ರವ್ಯ (B, Al, Ga, In) ಸ್ವೀಕಾರಕ; p-ಮಾದರಿ, ರಂಧ್ರಗಳು ಬಹುಸಂಖ್ಯಾತ. ಸ್ಫಟಿಕ ವಿದ್ಯುತ್ ತಟಸ್ಥ."
   }
  },
