  {
   "id": "sim1",
   "type": "interactive",
   "title": {
    "en": "Doping: n-type and p-type",
    "kn": "ಮಿಶ್ರಣ: n-ವಿಧ ಮತ್ತು p-ವಿಧ"
   },
   "narration": {
    "en": "Add a pentavalent atom (P, As) and its fifth electron is free: n-type, electrons are the majority carriers. Add a trivalent atom (B, Al) and a bond is left short: p-type, holes are the majority. Even tiny doping swamps the intrinsic carriers, yet ne × nh = ni² always holds. Silicon at 300 K, ni = 1.5 × 10¹⁶ m⁻³."
   },
   "seconds": 150,
   "optional": true,
   "kind": "scene",
   "caption": {
    "en": "Add a pentavalent atom (P, As) and its fifth electron is free: n-type, electrons are the majority carriers. Add a trivalent atom (B, Al) and a bond is left short: p-type, holes are the majority. Even tiny doping swamps the intrinsic carriers, yet ne × nh = ni² always holds. Silicon at 300 K, ni = 1.5 × 10¹⁶ m⁻³.",
    "kn": "ಪಂಚವೇಲೆನ್ಸಿ ಪರಮಾಣು (P, As) ಸೇರಿಸಿದರೆ ಐದನೇ ಎಲೆಕ್ಟ್ರಾನ್ ಮುಕ್ತ: n-ವಿಧ, ಎಲೆಕ್ಟ್ರಾನ್ ಬಹುಸಂಖ್ಯಾತ. ತ್ರಿವೇಲೆನ್ಸಿ ಪರಮಾಣು (B, Al) ಸೇರಿಸಿದರೆ ಒಂದು ಬಂಧ ಕೊರತೆ: p-ವಿಧ, ರಂಧ್ರ ಬಹುಸಂಖ್ಯಾತ. ಅಲ್ಪ ಮಿಶ್ರಣವೂ ಸಹಜ ವಾಹಕಗಳನ್ನು ಮೀರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ; ne × nh = ni² ಯಾವಾಗಲೂ."
   },
